  - apps/parity/android-ledger.json  page:notifications/Webhooks row (done, 2/2).

Notes:
  - i18n catalog generator: res/values*/strings.xml is AUTO-GENERATED by
    apps/shared/i18n/generators/gen-i18n.ts. The committed catalog is ALREADY
    drifted from en.json before this change (gen --check: 11 files, pre-existing,
    unrelated to this artifact — incl. apple/windows resources). To avoid
    sweeping that unrelated drift into this page artifact, the two new keys were
    added at the en.json source AND hand-inserted into the three Android
    strings.xml files byte-identically to what emitAndroidStrings()/androidName()/
    renderValue() produce (verified: androidName('translation.notifications.
    webhooks.title')=translation_notifications_webhooks_title; values "Webhooks"
    and "Custom HTTPS endpoints that receive HMAC-signed event payloads." carry no
    escapable chars; sorted between view_label↔onboarding_charging). A future full
    gen-i18n.ts run re-emits these exact lines (no conflict). aapt2 resource
    compilation accepted the three files (assembleDebug green; the only merge
    warnings are pre-existing battery_*/rateLimitStatus_* non-positional-format
    strings, not these keys). Honest disclosure (no silent drift).
  - SI: no webhook field on this surface is unit-bearing — no SI conversion.
  - States: WebhookChannelsSection renders loading / empty(no webhooks) /
    error+retry / content / stale-offline for its bound feed (verified by the
    shared WebhookChannelsSectionViewModelTest / WebhookChannelsSectionProjection
    Test + WebhookChannelsSectionUiTest, all green under testDebugUnitTest).
  - i18n: every visible literal via stringResource (ADR-014); web key names kept.
  - a11y: PageTitle heading + copy-link IconButton contentDescription; the feature
    view supplies row/modal/test content descriptions + dynamic/dark theme
    (ADR-015).
  - Layout: the feature view lays out as a non-lazy Column, so it composes safely
    inside the page's outer verticalScroll container.
  - Nav: /notifications/webhooks -> notificationsWebhooks already in Destinations.kt
    and asserted by RouteTableTest; this artifact supplies its PageHosts host.

